WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.440
What led me to get involved in the bus boycott [were] the policies, the attitudes of the policemen and the attitudes of the bus drivers.

2
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.860
They were very uncourteous to people,

3
00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:20.780
they talked to them as if they were inhuman . . . and I would think that about eighty percent of the riders at that time were black people!
